;justify-content:center;color:#555;font-size:12px;}\n  .caption{font-size:8.5px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:4px;text-align:justify;}\n  .br{flex:0 0 200px;border:1px solid #c00;padding:6px;box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .br .dtitle{background:#c00;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:6px;padding:2px 0;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;}\n  .br .item{border-bottom:1px dashed #c00;padding:8px 2px;text-align:center;}\n  .br .item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}\n  .br .kicker{color:#c00;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:3px;}\n  .br .t{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;}\n  .br .p{font-size:9px;color:#c00;margin-top:4px;}\n  .end{text-align:right;font-size:9px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ============ 报头 ============ -->\n  <div class=\"masthead\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"cn\">人民日报</div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"en\">RENMIN RIBAO</div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"site\">人民网网址：http：//www.people.com.cn</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"datebox\">\n      <div class=\"d1\">2025年3月</div>\n      <div class=\"num\">24</div>\n      <div>星期一</div>\n      <div>乙巳年二月廿五</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">人民日报社出版<br>\n        国内统一连续出版物号<br>\n        CN 11—0065<br>\n        代号1—1<br>\n        第 28016 期<br>\n        今日20版</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"headzone\">\n      <div class=\"redbar\">坚定信心，打开改革发展新天地</div>\n      <div class=\"h-main\">福建着力激发投资创业活力</div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">本报记者　付　文　施　钰</div>\n      <div class=\"cols2\">\n        <div>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n          <p>2024年10月，习近平总书记在福建考察时强调，坚持“两个毫不动摇”，加快建设现代化产业体系，进一步激发全社会投资创业活力。</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>丰记总书记殷殷嘱托，福建加快实施新时代民营经济强省战略，持续优化民营企业发展环境，促进民营经济高质量发展。</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n          <p>[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"end\">（下转第四版）</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============ 头条通讯 ============ -->\n  <div class=\"lead-title\">“党在新时代的徙木立信之举”</div>\n  <div class=\"lead-byline\">本报记者　杜尚泽　王　洲　申孟哲</div>\n  <hr class=\"thin\">\n\n  <div class=\"mainbody\">\n    <div class=\"article-cols\">\n\n      <!-- 第1栏 -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p>中央八项规定，无疑是读懂新时代中国共产党的一个鲜明标识。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-q\">一问：实施八项规定，意欲如何？</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-a\">“我们是能办成事的，而且是认真办事的”</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 第2栏 -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>2024年国家统计局的调查显示，94.9%的受访群众对中央八项规定精神贯彻落实成效表示肯定，达是人民群众给予的最好评价。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-q\">二问：驰而不息纠治，原因何在？</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-a\">“改进作风必须自上而下、以上率下”</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 第3栏 -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p>我担任了党的总书记，应该严格要求自己，带头恪守廉洁自律。</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-q\">三问：为什么不是“歇歇脚”，而是再奋发？</p>\n        <p class=\"sub-a\">“钉钉子嘛，再钉几下，久久为功，化风为俗”</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p class=\"end\">（下转第四版）</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 第4栏 -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n        <p>[illegible]</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 右侧竖排单条 -->\n    <div class=\"vert-col\">\n      <div class=\"vtitle\">李强出席中国发展高层论坛<br>二〇二五年年会开幕式并发表主旨演讲</div>\n      <div class=\"vtext\">\n        新华社北京3月23日电　（记者[illegible]）国务院总理李强23日上午在北京出席中国发展高层论坛2025年年会开幕式并发表主旨演讲。<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============ 下部三栏 ============ -->\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n\n    <!-- 左：竖排标题稿 -->\n    <div class=\"bl\">\n      <div class=\"bkicker\">去年八月以来</div>\n      <div class=\"btitle\">消费者购买以旧换新家电近九千万台</div>\n      <div class=\"btext\">\n        本报北京3月23日电　（记者王明）2025年国家电熊费季启动以来，[illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]<br>\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 中：图片 -->\n    <div class=\"bc\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:250px;margin:0;\">\n        [Photo: 春日花海写生场景，位于版面下部中央]\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"caption\">\n        春和景明，万物复苏，人们踏青赏景，乐享美好春光。图为江苏省溧阳市曹山花海景区，游客在写生绘景。<br>\n        徐工商摄（影像中国）\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 右：导读 -->\n    <div class=\"br\">\n      <div class=\"dtitle\">导读</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"t\">深入学习贯彻习近平经济思想，<br>确保我国经济航船乘风破浪、行稳致远</div>\n        <div class=\"p\">第五版</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">理论</div>\n        <div class=\"t\">教育强国成于实干</div>\n        <div class=\"p\">第九版</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">践行正确政绩观</div>\n        <div class=\"t\">一条3公里的河，为何成了3次治了5年？</div>\n        <div class=\"p\">第十一版</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">大家谈人生</div>\n        <div class=\"t\">让传统回到日常</div>\n        <div class=\"p\">第二十四版</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
